 compact, firm, solid, L.; = -च्छन्दस् below, TāṇḍBr., Sch.;

व्य्-उच्-√ चर् (-उद्-√ चर्) P. Ā. -चरति, ˚ते, to go forth in different directions, ŚBr.;
to go out of the right path, transgress or offend against, be faithless or disloyal towards (acc.), MBh.;
to commit adultery with (instr.), ib.

व्य्-उत्-√ क्रम् P. -क्रामति, to go apart or in different directions, AitBr.; ŚBr.;
to overstep, transgress, neglect, Ragh.;
to go astray, MW.

(-उद्-√ स्था) P. Ā. -तिष्ठति, ˚ते, to rise in different directions (as light), RV.;
to turn away from (abl.), give up, abandon, ŚBr.;
to swerve from duty, forget one's self, MBh.; R.;
to come back (from sea, cf. व्य्-उत्-√ पद्), Divyāv. :
Caus. -थापयति, to cause to rise up &c.;
to call in question, disagree about (acc.), MBh.;
to seduce, win over, ib.;
to set aside, remove, depose (from a place), Kathās.;
to abandon treacherously, ib.

व्य्-उत्-√ पद् Ā. -पद्यते (aor. व्युद्-अपादि), to proceed from, arise, originate, have origin or derivation (esp. in gram.), be derived (from a root &c.), Śiś. x, 23;
 (P.) to come back (from sea, cf. व्य्-उत्था), Divyāv.;
to resist (?), ib. :
Caus. -पादयति, to cause to arise or come forth, produce, cause, BhP.;
 (in gram.) to derive, trace back to a root &c., Śaṃk.;
to discuss in detail, Hcar. :
Desid. See व्य्-उत्पित्सु, col. 2.

व्य्-उत्-√ सद् P. -सीदति, to go out or away, AitBr.;
to be unsettled, MW.;
to be upset or overthrown, ib.

व्य्-उद्-√ अस् P. -अस्यति, to throw about, scatter, Kauś.; MBh.;
to discharge, emit, Gaut.;
to cast off, reject, give up, abandon, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

व्य्-उप-√ रम् Ā. -रमते (ep. also ˚ति; ind.p. -रमम्; in augmented forms not separable from व्य्-उपा-√ रम् below),
to leave off or pause variously, ĀśvŚr.;
to come to an end, cease, MBh.; Hariv.;
to desist from (abl.), MBh.

1. व्युष् (also read प्युष्) cl. 4. P. व्युषति, to burn (in this sense perhaps = व्य्-उष्), Dhātup. xxvi, 7;
to divide, distribute (in this sense also written प्युस्, पुष्, ब्युस्, बुस्), ib. 108;
 cl. 10. P. व्योषयति, to reject, discharge, emit (in this sense also written पुस्), ib. xxxii, 92.

व्य्-√ ऊह् P. -ऊहति (ep. also ˚ते impf. अव्यूहत, ˚हन्त as if fr. a √ व्यूह्), to push or move apart, place asunder, divide, distribute, TS.; ŚBr.; ŚrS.; ĪśUp.;
to arrange, place in order, draw up in battle-array, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to shift, transpose, alter, AitBr.; ŚBr.; ĀśvŚr.;
to separate, resolve (vowels, Saṃdhi &c.), RPrāt.

